  "limits": "The two October 2013 camera stations have independently recorded coordinates and headings. Neither pair of bearings for the corresponding lower window intersects in front of both cameras. Limiting the rays to 3–85 metres measures their separation rather than assigning a facade point. The indicated image uncertainty is about three pixels, with unknown absolute station offsets and stitching error. Four-window layout and thin raised flower guard in the dated original are identifiable throughout the published 2013, 2015 and 2021 street photographs.",
  "conclusion": "照片和武定西路蓝牌能识别万航渡路转角的同一临街墙。两台2013年全景相机的定位与街景方位不能给两窗建立共同正向交点。保留原有街屋、完整屋面和地面，本件独立展示窗带及外挑铁花架。 真实两期按近、远档逐种复核。原1435的整栋壳体约288.8平方米，高20.8米。"
